  "bio": "Step into Birmingham Ink Tattoo, the United Kingdom's haven for understated elegance, where minimalist and black & gray artistry transforms skin into bespoke masterpieces. Proudly nestled in the heart of Birmingham, this studio not only specializes in inking, but also provides expert cover-ups, body piercing, microdermals, and professional laser removal. Contact them at 0121 233 2331 for an immersive experience in body art and modification.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Birmingham, England, United Kingdom\n\nest. 2006 𝐒𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐢𝐚𝐥𝐢𝐬𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐢𝐧 𝐐𝐔𝐀𝐋𝐈𝐓𝐘 𝐓𝐀𝐓𝐓𝐎𝐎𝐈𝐍𝐆               \n-𝐂𝐨𝐯𝐞𝐫𝐮𝐩𝐬  \n-𝐁𝐨𝐝𝐲 𝐏𝐢𝐞𝐫𝐜𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐌𝐢𝐜𝐫𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐫𝐦𝐚𝐥𝐬\n-𝐋𝐚𝐬𝐞𝐫 𝐑𝐞𝐦𝐨𝐯𝐚𝐥 ☠️💖  -𝐓𝐨𝐨𝐭𝐡 𝐆𝐞𝐦𝐬💎",
